                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-583cd96b49" class="cmp-text">
    <ul><li><span class="p1">Australia: <a title="URL link to Scam Watch Aus website" href="https://www.scamwatch.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scam Watch</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">New Zealand: <a title="URL link to Consumer protection" href="https://www.consumerprotection.govt.nz/general-help/scamwatch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Consumer Protection </a></span></li></ul>

