<div id="text-bbbb067e77" class="cmp-text">
    <ul><li><span class="p1">Hong Kong: <a title="URL link to ADCC website" href="https://www.adcc.gov.hk/en-hk/home.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anti-Deception Co-ordination Center</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">Indonesia: <a href="https://ojk.go.id/waspada-investasi/id/alert-portal/Pages/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OJK Alert Portal</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">Japan: <a title="URL link to Japan Anti Fraud website" href="https://japanantifraud.org/news-alerts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Japan Anti Fraud</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">Malaysia: <a title="URL link to investor alert list" href="https://www.sc.com.my/investor-alert-list" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Investor Alert List</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">Singapore: <a title="URL link to Scam Alert website" href="https://www.scamalert.sg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scam Alert</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">Thailand: <a href="https://market.sec.or.th/public/idisc/th/InvestorAlert" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEC Investor list</a></span></li><li><span class="p1">The Philippines: <a href="https://scamwatchpilipinas.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scam Watch</a></span></li></ul>

