        <div class="content-block">
            <div class="content-block__text">
                
                    <h2 class="cmp-tile-fact__heading">
                      <span class="cmp-tile-fact__heading-text">
                          Multi-factor Authentication
                      </span>
                    </h2>
                
                <div class="cmp-tile-fact__description">
                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-e478fbe17b" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Using another layer of authentication in addition to your username and password, is preferable if your data is sensitive. If your account offers multi-factor authentication, you should enable it.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>

    
    


    

</div>
