                    <h2 class="cmp-tile-fact__heading">
                      <span class="cmp-tile-fact__heading-text">
                          Anti-virus software 
                      </span>
                    </h2>
                
                <div class="cmp-tile-fact__description">
                  <div><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-a3c781f558" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Install an anti-virus software and keep it updated to reduce the likelihood of being impacted by malware.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>

    
    


    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-e6a3c8c3f7" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Reporting fraud and online threats</h3>
<p>If you have experienced an online threat or have fallen victim to phishing or any other type of online fraud/scam that may involve the Macquarie brand please notify us by email at <a href="mailto:globalinvestigations&#64;macquarie.com">globalinvestigations&#64;macquarie.com.</a> If possible, please send your contact phone number and the suspicious email as an attachment, rather than forwarding the email. This helps to identify the author and source and will be used to help reduce online fraud.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>


    
    
    <div class="colour-block"><div class="my-width-full colour-block  dark-text" data-component="true">
    <div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-c1a9256fa5" class="cmp-text">
    <h2>Global fraud and security resource matrix</h2>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-021f589a75" class="cmp-text">
    <p>The accordion below outlines the regions and countries that Macquarie operate in and the regulators, reporting authorities and consumer assistance services available to the local population to report instances of fraud and scams etc.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
