    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-336c6cae3c" class="cmp-text">
    <h2>Reporting security threats</h2>
<p>Urgent and high-risk security threats or incidents, such as extortion attempts, violence towards staff, bomb threats and suspicious packages and any life safety incident can be reported immediately to the Macquarie 24/7 Global Security Operations Centre (GSOC): <a href="mailto:GSOC&#64;macquarie.com">GSOC&#64;macquarie.com</a>.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>


    
    
